    text: "Affected stops:\r\nLouisiana Ave & S Downing St (#15054) (eastbound)\r\n1600 Block Louisiana Ave (#15059) (eastbound)\r\nS Gaylord St & Louisiana Ave (#14075) (eastbound)\r\nMississippi Ave & S Gaylord St (#15365) (eastbound)\r\nLouisiana Ave & S Gaylord St (#21466) (westbound)\r\nLouisiana Ave & S Franklin St (#15058) (westbound)\r\nLouisiana Ave & S Downing St Nearside (#15055) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 11 get on/off buses at:\r\nLouisiana / Pearl Station Gate A (#15056)\r\nMississippi Ave & S University Blvd (#15454)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 11 get on/off buses at:\r\nS Gaylord St & Mississippi Ave (#14076)\r\nLouisiana Ave & S Downing St Farside (#33012)"
